    "description": "SAP India Capital India has an exciting opening for a Frontend Developer at our Indore office. Join a company that values innovation, collaboration, and continuous learning.\n\nAbout SAP India Capital India:\nSAP India Capital India is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Contribute to system architecture and technical design decisions\n• Optimize application performance and ensure high availability\n• Mentor junior developers and conduct knowledge-sharing sessions\n• Work with agile methodologies including daily stand-ups and sprint planning\n• Participate in code reviews and contribute to technical discussions\n• Participate in on-call rotation for production support\n• Implement new features based on product requirements\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Any graduate with relevant experience\n• 6-10 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in JavaScript\n• Proficiency in Python\n• Proficiency in TensorFlow\n• Proficiency in SQL\n• Proficiency in Java\n• Proficiency in REST APIs\n• Proficiency in React\n• Proficiency in TypeScript\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Employee stock options (ESOPs) for eligible roles\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• Referral bonus program\n• Salary Range: 12 LPA - 25 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Indore, Madhya Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with SAP India Capital India!",
